[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4462158125","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118486#issuecomment-4462158125","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118486","id":4462158125,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCfchLQ","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-15T18:15:25Z","updated_at":"2026-05-15T18:16:10Z","body":"This makes sense as a temporary hacky workaround to me. Since it seems the issue is specific to the language server instantiating scenes. Plus it should be pretty safe","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4462158125/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4462274742","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118486#issuecomment-4462274742","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118486","id":4462274742,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCfjotg","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-15T18:28:40Z","updated_at":"2026-05-15T18:28:40Z","body":"> GDScript language server might instantiate scenes\r\n\r\nAs a side note, what conditions would the language server instantiate scenes? This kind of feels similar to the problem that https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109297 solved. In the sense that objects are being created by GDscript editor functionality behind the scenes and triggering unanticipated side effects.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4462274742/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4462327544","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118486#issuecomment-4462327544","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118486","id":4462327544,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCfm2-A","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-15T18:35:33Z","updated_at":"2026-05-15T18:35:33Z","body":"The language server searches for a scene which has the current script attached, and does instantiate it. This is required to get autocompletion for `$GetNodeLiterals` working. I don't think it is comparable to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109297 because instantiating scenes is a common occurrence in the editor.\r\n\r\nIn particular the builtin editor does not need to do it, since the scene tabs in the editor already hold an instantiated instance.\r\n\r\nWorth noting that this issue could also be triggered by editor plugins.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4462327544/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/re